title: "Reproducibility code for \"Edge-cusped weak compactons in degenerate nonlinear dispersive equations\""
abstract: "Python code that regenerates every figure, table, and numerical constant of the manuscript on edge-cusped weak compactons of the equation (1/m)(u^m)_t + alpha (u^n)_x + beta [u^a (u^b)_xx]_x = 0."
